{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getArrayLit?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">getArrayLit?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Check if an expression is an array literal\n(i.e. `List.toArray` applied to a nested chain of `List.cons`, ending at a `List.nil`),\nreturning the array of `Expr` values.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getArrayLit?","kind":"def","line":454,"name":"Lean.Meta.getArrayLit?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/LitValues.lean#L454-L459"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getArrayLitOf?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">getArrayLitOf?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Check if an expression is an array literal\n(i.e. `List.toArray` applied to a nested chain of `List.cons`, ending at a `List.nil`),\nwhere each element is \"recognised\" by a given function `f : Expr → MetaM (Option α)`,\nand return the array of recognised values.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getArrayLitOf?","kind":"def","line":442,"name":"Lean.Meta.getArrayLitOf?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/LitValues.lean#L442-L452"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getListLit?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">getListLit?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Check if an expression is a list literal (i.e. a nested c