.html#Lean.Meta.isLitValue","kind":"def","line":373,"name":"Lean.Meta.isLitValue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/LitValues.lean#L373-L388"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.normLitValue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">normLitValue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `e` is a literal value, ensure it is encoded using the standard representation.\nOtherwise, just return `e`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.normLitValue","kind":"def","line":296,"name":"Lean.Meta.normLitValue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/LitValues.lean#L296-L318"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.floatLitValuesEq?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">floatLitValuesEq?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `a` and `b` are both `Float` or both `Float32` literals, returns whether they denote the same\nvalue. Values are compared by bit pattern, consistent with the `DecidableEq` instances.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.floatLitValuesEq?","kind":"def","line":283,"name":"Lean.Meta.floatLitValuesEq?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/LitValues.lean#L283-L292"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getFloat32Value?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">getFloat32Value?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Return `some v` if `e` is a `Float32` literal: an `OfScientific` or `OfNat` application, or `Neg.neg`\nof either (e.g. `-1.5`).","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getFloat32Value?","kind":"def","line":273,"name":"Lean.Meta.getFloat32Value?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/LitValues.lean#L273-L281"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LitValues.html#Lean.Meta.getFloatValue?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">getFloatValue?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\"